OL,3,GNEWSAResidents return home after crews
OL,4,Atackle garage fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral properties were evacuated as
OL,7,Ffire crews tackle a fire at a garage in
OL,8,FWoodville.
OL,10,FHigh Street was shut between Hepworth
OL,11,FRoad and Clock roundabout due to the
OL,12,Fblaze but reopened later on Thursday.
OL,14,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,15,Ftwo fire crews from Swadlincote and two
OL,16,Fcrews from Leicestershire went to the
OL,17,Fscene.
OL,19,FA number of properties were evacuated
OL,20,Fbut police said all residents had now
OL,21,Fbeen allowed home.
